    "enUS": {
      "description": "I know you were initially sent here on reconnaissance, {name}, but you've done a great deal for the field of archaeology.\r\n\r\nSurely, after all of your toil, you'd like to know what fruits my studies will come to bear.\r\n\r\nTo that end, before you return to your camp, I'd like to show you something. Would you oblige me?",
